QS30 A9.2 isolated passive discharge all_high_rc
* No converter energy input. Sense dividers omitted, bleeders only.
COUT HV_BUS 0 2.436e-05 IC=220
RBLEED HV_BUS 0 50500.0
.control
set noaskquit
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
tran 0.001 12 uic
meas tran end_time MAX time
meas tran final_voltage FIND v(HV_BUS) AT=12
wrdata voltage.txt v(HV_BUS)
quit
.endc
.end
